.
@@eDRAGONFALL@@N

@@WFrom the plunge, a new age is born.@@N

In the age before ages the @@ySky-Breaker@@N (the First Wyrm) fell from the
firmament. The impact carved the @@WScar@@N — a living wound of dragonbone,
impact-glass, and residual fire. From corpse and crater the new age grew.

@@WThe Scar@@N is home: Rib-Cage District, Great Spine, Heart-Pulse Sanctum
(recall). Adventurers leave into the @@WWound-lands@@N to gather scale, blood,
bone, breath, and will — to finish what the dragon started, prevent a second
fall, or become the next axis of the world.

Progression climbs the wound (Great Spine Waystation south of the west gate).
See also the area helps for each band (@@yhelp spineway@@N, outer watch, etc.).

Full bible: docs/dragonfall-lore.md in the source tree.
